<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU" class="no-js" data-sig="links:bg,buttons:lift,tilt:0">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Conn Building — New Homes, Renovations &amp; Decks | Newcastle &amp; Hunter</title>
<meta name="description" content="Conn Building — licensed builder across Newcastle &amp; Hunter. New homes, renovations, extensions, decks &amp; structural repairs. Firm quotes, on-site management, fixed-price contracts.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Conn Building — Licensed Builder, Newcastle &amp; Hunter">
<meta property="og:description" content="New homes, renovations, decks &amp; structural repairs — firm quotes, on-site management. Newcastle &amp; Hunter Region.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/conn_photo_4.jpg">
<link rel="icon" href="assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script>document.documentElement.classList.remove('no-js');document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #1B1C1E;
  --paper: #FCFCFC;
  --paper2: #F2F2F3;
  --ink: #1D1B1C;
  --ink2: #585758;
  --acc: #9fa2a5;
  --acc2: #c9cbcd;
  --acc-dark: #47484B;
  --acc-ink: #5F6266;
  --line: rgba(29,26,22,.16);
  --chip: #f4f4f3;
  --warm: #b7b9bc;
  --warm-light: #F0F0F2;
  --deep: #0F0F11;
  --fluid: clamp(44px, 9vw, 118px);
  --disp: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
  --disp-alt: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
  --body-font: 'Archivo', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --gut: clamp(20px, 3.2vw, 44px);
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
html, body { overflow-x: hidden; }
body { font-family: var(--body-font); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--disp); }
.mono { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; }
a { color: inherit; }
::selection { background: var(--acc); color: var(--paper); }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation-duration: .001s !important; transition-duration: .001s !important; } }

.nav { position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto 0; z-index: 60; background: rgba(26,22,18,.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,149,106,.18); }
.nav-in { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; height: 72px; max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--gut); }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; flex-shrink: 0; }
.brand-mark{height:48px;width:auto;object-fit:contain}
.brand-txt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1; min-width: 0; }
.brand-name { font-family: var(--disp); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .01em; }
.brand-sub { font-size: .72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 3px; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-left: auto; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a { color: #d4ccc7; text-decoration: none; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .03em; }
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--acc2); }
.nav-cta { display: flex; gap: .8rem; align-items: center; margin-left: 1rem; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
.nav-cta .btn-primary { background: var(--acc); color: #1a1612; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.45); }
.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; padding: .85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: .94rem; transition: transform .15s ease, filter .15s ease; }
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); filter: brightness(1.06); }
.btn-primary { background: var(--acc); color: #1a1612; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.32); }
.btn-ghost { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); background: transparent; }
.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
.burger { display: none; margin-left: .5rem; background: none; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); border-radius: 6px; padding: .35rem .5rem; cursor: pointer; }
.burger span { display: block; width: 20px; height: 2px; background: #fff; margin: 4px 0; transition: .3s; }
.burger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg); }
.burger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
.burger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg); }
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-in { height: 66px; padding: 0 16px; }
  .brand-mark{height:48px;width:auto;object-fit:contain}
  .brand-name { font-size: 1rem; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 44vw; }
  .brand-sub { display: none; }
  .nav-links { position: fixed; inset: 66px 0 auto 0; background: rgba(26,22,18,.98); flex-direction: column; padding: 1rem; gap: .8rem; transform: translateY(-140%); transition: transform .35s ease; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,149,106,.18); }
  .nav-links.open { transform: none; }
  .nav-links a { width: 100%; text-align: center; padding: .5rem 0; color: #fefefe; }
  .nav-cta { display: none; }
  .burger { display: block; }
}

.hero{position:relative;min-height:clamp(720px,100svh,1100px);display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;padding-top:96px}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(10,11,12,.95) 0%,rgba(10,11,12,.7) 50%,rgba(10,11,12,.3) 100%)}
.hero-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(13,11,9,.98) 0%,rgba(13,11,9,.85) 10%,rgba(13,11,9,.55) 28%,rgba(13,11,9,.25) 50%,transparent 85%)}
.hero-grain{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.03;pointer-events:none;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="240" height="240"><filter id="n"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.8" numOctaves="4" stitchTiles="stitch"/></filter><rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(%23n)" fill="%238b6b42"/></svg>');background-size:clamp(200px,15vw,360px)}
.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.1;pointer-events:none;background-image:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(212,165,116,.12) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(212,165,116,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:clamp(58px,7.6vw,128px) clamp(58px,7.6vw,128px);-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,#000 15%,#000 45%,transparent 75%);mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,#000 15%,#000 45%,transparent 75%)}
.hero-3d{display:none;perspective:900px}
#heroCanvas{display:none!important;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:3;padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vh,80px);width:100%;max-width:min(1360px,94vw);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:clamp(32px,4vw,60px);align-items:end;padding-left:var(--gut);padding-right:var(--gut)}
.hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:3}
.hero-copy::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-8% -6%;background:radial-gradient(112% 76% at 26% 46%,rgba(255,255,255,.04),rgba(255,255,255,0) 76%);z-index:-1;pointer-events:none}
.hero-visual{display:block}
.hero-visual img{width:100%;height:min(64vh,620px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 44%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 20px 48px rgba(30,33,36,.2)}
.hero-visual figcaption{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.95);text-align:left;margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;color:#f5f0e8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600;text-shadow:0 1px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.7);white-space:normal;max-width:100%;margin-top:2.5rem}
.hero-sub{color:#fefefe;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.6);margin-top:.8rem;line-height:1.65}
.hero h1{color:#fefefe!important;line-height:1.06!important;max-width:18ch;font-size:var(--fluid);margin-top:.2rem}
.hero h1 .acc{color:var(--acc)!important;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.hero-cta{margin-top:1.6rem}
.hero-trust{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:.5rem 1rem;margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:.88rem;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:700}
.hero-trust span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;padding:.5rem .9rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:1px solid rgba(212,165,116,.45);border-radius:999px;color:#fefefe;text-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.hero-trust span::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acc);flex-shrink:0}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .hero-trust{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-trust span{font-size:.8rem;padding:.4rem .75rem}
}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:2rem;margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;align-items:center}
.hero-stats .stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.1rem;text-align:center}
.hero-stats .stat-main strong{font-size:1.8rem}
.hero-stats strong{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--acc);line-height:1}
.hero-stats span{color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);font-weight:500;font-size:.7rem}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .hero{min-height:auto;display:block;background:var(--bg);padding-top:66px}
  .hero-bg,.hero-scrim,.hero-grain,.hero-grid,.hero-3d{display:none}
  #heroCanvas{display:none}
  .hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:30px;max-width:100vw;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}
  .hero-visual{order:-1}
  .hero-visual img{height:min(30vh,240px);border-radius:6px}
  .hero-visual figcaption{font-size:11.5px}
  .hero-copy{padding-left:0}
  .hero-copy::before{display:none}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(31px,8.6vw,46px);margin-top:14px}
  .hero-sub{margin-top:14px}
  .hero-cta{margin-top:18px}
  .eyebrow{white-space:normal;font-size:11px}
  .hero-trust{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-stats{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;justify-content:center}
}

section { padding: 5.4rem 0; scroll-margin-top:84px; }
section[id], header[id] { scroll-margin-top:84px; }
.wrap { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--gut); }
.sec-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.6rem; }
.sec-head::before { content: ""; width: 40px; height: 3px; background: var(--acc); flex: none; align-self: center; }
.sec-idx { font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc-ink); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.sec-kicker { font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc-ink); font-weight: 800; }
.sec-title { font-family: var(--disp); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.6vw, 2.9rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: .3rem; max-width: 28ch; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.lead { color: var(--ink2); max-width: 60ch; margin-top: .9rem; }
.svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(292px, 1fr)); gap: 1.15rem; }
.svc { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.65rem 1.5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
.svc:hover { border-color: var(--acc); transform: translateY(-3px); }
.svc::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 44px; height: 3px; background: var(--acc); transition: width .3s ease; }
.svc:hover::after { width: 100%; }
.svc h3 { font-family: var(--disp); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.12rem; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
.svc p { color: var(--ink2); font-size: .94rem; }
.svc-n { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--acc-ink); letter-spacing: .1em; }
.svc-arrow { color: var(--acc-ink); font-size: 1.2rem; position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 18px; }
.steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(292px, 1fr)); gap: 1.15rem; }
.step { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.55rem 1.45rem; }
.step-n { font-family: var(--disp); font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--acc-ink); margin-bottom: .5rem; font-weight: 900; }
.step h3 { font-family: var(--disp); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.06rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
.step p { color: var(--ink2); font-size: .92rem; }
.faq-wrap { max-width: 900px; }
details.faq { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 0; }
details.faq:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
details.faq summary { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
details.faq summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 26px; color: var(--acc-ink); font-weight: 400; transition: transform .2s; }
details.faq[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
details.faq .a { color: var(--ink2); padding: 14px 0 4px; max-width: 700px; }
.tst-grid, .trust-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
.tst { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 30px; position: relative; }
.tst-q { font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; color: var(--acc-ink); font-weight: 900; height: 30px; }
.tst p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 8px; }
.tst-a { margin-top: 20px; }
.tst-a b { font-size: 15px; }
.stat-band { background: var(--bg); color: #fefefe; }
.stat-band .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.stat { padding: 2.2rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
.stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
.stat b { display: block; font-family: var(--disp); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); color: var(--acc); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
.stat span { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); font-size: 1.02rem; letter-spacing: .02em; }
@media(max-width:900px){.stat-band .wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stat{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.stat:last-child,.stat:nth-last-child(2){border-bottom:none}}
@media(max-width:520px){.stat{padding:1.7rem 1rem}.stat b{font-size:clamp(1.55rem,6.6vw,2.6rem)}}
.hgal { overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; cursor: grab; }
.hgal.dragging { cursor: grabbing; }
.hgal-nav { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0 var(--gut) 8px; }
.hgal-btn { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s, color .15s, transform .12s; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.hgal-btn:hover { background: var(--acc-dark); color: #fff; border-color: var(--acc-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.hgal::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.hgal .track { display: flex; gap: 22px; width: max-content; padding: 0 var(--gut) 26px; }
.hg-item { position: relative; flex: none; width: min(420px, 78vw); }
.hg-item img { width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 8px; transition: transform .3s ease; }
.hg-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); }
.hg-item figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 4px 0; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.hg-item figcaption .mono { color: var(--acc-ink); font-size: 11px; }

/* reveal — continuous scroll */
.rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity .45s ease, transform .8s ease; }
.rv.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
.rv.d1 { transition-delay: .08s; } .rv.d2 { transition-delay: .16s; } .rv.d3 { transition-delay: .24s; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .rv { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
html.no-js .rv,
html:not(.js) .rv {
  opacity: 1 !important;
  transform: none !important;
  transition: none !important;
}

footer { background: var(--bg); color: #fefefe; padding: 4.5rem 0 0; }
footer .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
.fbrand img { height: 64px; width: auto; border-radius: 4px; display: block; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
.fbrand .brand-name { color: #fff; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.fbrand .brand-sub { display: block; color: var(--acc2); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-top: .2rem; }
footer p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); font-size: .88rem; max-width: 280px; margin-top: 1rem; }
footer h4 { font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800; }
footer a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); text-decoration: none; font-size: .88rem; display: block; padding: .3rem 0; transition: color .15s; }
footer a:hover { color: var(--acc2); }
.footer-bar { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); padding: 1.5rem var(--gut); max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: .76rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.58); }
.footer-bar a { display: inline; color: var(--acc2); font-weight: 700; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem 1.5rem; } }
@media (max-width: 520px) { footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.8rem; } .footer-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: .35rem; } }

/* pulse (required) */
.lb-pulse{position:fixed;bottom:1.5rem;right:1.5rem;width:12px;height:12px;background:var(--acc);border-radius:50%;opacity:.6;animation:lbpulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none;z-index:999}
@keyframes lbpulse{0%,100%{opacity:.3;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.2)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.lb-pulse{animation:none;opacity:.5}}
</style>
<style id="lb-brand-css">
/* ==== LB BRAND (logo-true spanning wordmark) ==== */
.lb-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(9px,1vw,16px);text-decoration:none;
 color:inherit;min-width:0;padding:0;background:none;border:0;flex:0 1 auto}
.lb-brand__mark{flex:0 0 auto;display:block;height:clamp(34px,4.1vw,58px);width:auto;max-width:22vw}
.lb-brand__mark img{display:block;height:100%;width:auto;max-width:22vw;object-fit:contain}
.lb-brand__word{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:0;line-height:.94}
.lb-brand__name{font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(21px,2.75vw,44px);letter-spacing:.004em;white-space:nowrap;line-height:.92;
 color:var(--lb-name,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__name .lb-acc{color:var(--lb-acc,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__sub{font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(7px,.82vw,12px);letter-spacing:.30em;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:.34em;
 color:var(--lb-subc,currentColor);opacity:.86}
.lb-brand__rule{display:block;height:3px;width:100%;margin-top:.5em;border-radius:2px;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--lb-acc,currentColor),transparent)}
@media (max-width:640px){
 .lb-brand__mark{height:clamp(30px,8vw,40px)}
 .lb-brand__name{font-size:clamp(18px,6.2vw,26px)}
 .lb-brand__sub{letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:7px}
}
</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-in">
    <a class="lb-brand" href="#top" aria-label="Conn Building - Home" style="--lb-disp:Inter;--lb-sub:Inter;"><span class="lb-brand__word"><span class="lb-brand__name">Conn Building</span><span class="lb-brand__sub">Newcastle &amp; Hunter Region</span><span class="lb-brand__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
    <div class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Our Work</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get a free quote</a>
    </div>
    <button class="burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top"><!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-3d" aria-hidden="true"><canvas id="heroCanvas" width="16" height="16"></canvas></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">New homes • Renovations • Decks • Structural repairs</span>
    <h1>Structures built with <span class="acc">purpose.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">New homes, renovations, extensions, decks and structural repairs — delivered by a builder who's on site every day. Fixed-price contracts. No handballing.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a></div>
    <div class="hero-trust"><span>Licensed builder</span><span>Fully insured</span><span>Fixed-price contracts</span><span>On-site management</span></div>
    <div class="hero-stats"><span class="stat stat-main"><strong>15+</strong><span>Projects delivered</span></span><span class="stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Fixed-price quotes</span></span><span class="stat"><strong>Local</strong><span>Newcastle &amp; Hunter</span></span></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-visual"><img src="assets/conn_photo_1.jpg" alt="Conn Building project — timber deck and outdoor living" width="1200" height="1119"><figcaption>Timber deck &amp; outdoor living — Conn Building project</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we build.</h2><p class="lead">From the first sketch to the final walk-through — one builder who owns the project so nothing slips between trades.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>New home builds</h3><p>Custom-designed new homes built to your spec — single or double-storey, acreage or urban block.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Renovations &amp; extensions</h3><p>Room additions, kitchen &amp; bathroom upgrades, granny flats and second-storey additions.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Decks &amp; outdoor living</h3><p>Timber and composite decks, alfresco areas, verandahs and covered entertaining spaces.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Structural repairs &amp; maintenance</h3><p>Foundation repairs, wall cracks, roof structure repairs and general building maintenance.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">How a build runs.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Consultation &amp; design</h3><p>We listen to what you need, offer design advice and prepare a scope of works.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Firm quote</h3><p>Written quote with inclusions, exclusions and a realistic timeline — fixed price.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Construction</h3><p>Your project managed from excavation to handover — one point of contact, no handballing.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Handover &amp; aftercare</h3><p>Final walk-through, documentation and post-completion support.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every project.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>How much does a new home build cost?</summary><div class="a">It varies by size, specification and site. We provide firm, written quotes after a site assessment so there are no surprises.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Are you licensed and insured?</summary><div class="a">Yes — fully licensed and insured. We can provide our licence number and certificate of currency any time.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">Newcastle, Lake Macquarie and the Hunter Region.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>How long does a typical build take?</summary><div class="a">From slab to handover, a standard single-storey home takes 6-9 months depending on weather, approvals and finishes.</div></details>
</div></section>

<section class="stat-band band" id="stats"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="stat rv"><b>15+</b><span>projects delivered</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><b>Insured</b><span>&amp; licensed builder</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><b>100%</b><span>fixed-price quotes</span></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><b>Local</b><span>Newcastle &amp; Hunter crew</span></div>
</div></section>

<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-idx">04</div><div><h2 class="rv d1">Our work.</h2><p class="lead rv d2">Real builds, real results — every photo one of ours.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="hgal rv"><div class="track">
  <figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/conn_photo_4.jpg" alt="Conn Building — residential construction site with foundation slab" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Site &amp; foundation</span><span class="mono">/01</span></figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/conn_photo_1.jpg" alt="Conn Building — timber deck and outdoor living" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Deck &amp; outdoor</span><span class="mono">/02</span></figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/conn_photo_2.jpg" alt="Conn Building — renovated bathroom interior" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Bathroom renovation</span><span class="mono">/03</span></figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/conn_photo_3.jpg" alt="Conn Building — excavation and site preparation" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Excavation &amp; site prep</span><span class="mono">/04</span></figcaption></figure>
</div></div>
